{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>旅居貴州國際推介會在本港舉行，兩地文旅產業代表出席。</p><p></p><p>推介會由貴州省文化和旅遊廳及省政府港澳事務辦公室等部門共同主辦，主題為「旅居到貴州，生活更多彩」。現場設有自由洽談區、旅居要素體驗區等，展示當地三大旅居特色，包括避暑、貴南陽光及養生。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Untitled3.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026cmrotG1i5I1792329270.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>業界認為，旅居是旅遊發展必然趨勢，貴州近年憑藉山水美景、宜居氣候條件、豐富人文風情等，積極發展相關產業。會上有本港代表指出，香港可發揮國際化平台與金融優勢，與貴州攜手開拓海外客源市場。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"90S-2026 - 截图5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/c30187d6ec4346e6a05adb2a8fb85afc/snapshots/265d05ac4f484333b1bbae5bd5b38c79-00005.jpg\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"90S-2026 - 截图4\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/c30187d6ec4346e6a05adb2a8fb85afc/snapshots/265d05ac4f484333b1bbae5bd5b38c79-00004.jpg\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T14:19:05.579177+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":212,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T12:35:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T16:57:45.181292+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T14:17:37.302417+00:00","content_hash":"888f5a751afb77d49286ae3a31f62d0291c5de56ebeeb91dac5181234acd7c2c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}